# 2026 Q4 — Lean Bulk 1

> [!abstract] Block 2 of the [[Cycle Roadmap (to FFMI 28-29)]] — first lean bulk after the [[2026 Q3 Cut to 15%|cut]]. ~Oct–Dec 2026.
> Endocrine per [[Endocrine Design Rules]] (continuous Test + one lateral). Phase logic: [[Lean Bulk Protocol]].

- **P1 Endocrine:** continuous **[[Testosterone Enanthate Etho 450 (450mg-ml ×10ml) — beligaspharmacy Intl|Test E 450]] + [[Boldenone Undecanoate (250mg-ml ×10ml) — kohohpharma|EQ (Boldenone)]]** lateral (EQ replaces Primobolan — owned, cheaper, E2-friendly, appetite + endurance bonus for a bulk). **Proviron dropped** here (E2 managed by EQ; Proviron stays on cuts only). Per [[Endocrine Design Rules]] (Rule 2b).

> [!info] ⚖️ EQ dose — potency-adjusted (kohoh "Equibolone")
> Labelled **250mg/ml** but HPLC-assayed at **209.80mg/ml (~84%)** — so dose by **volume** to hit the real target, not the label.
> - **Target ~400mg real EQ/wk → pin 1.9 ml/wk** (≈475mg label), split EOD (~0.95ml ×2). _(Your "450mg" = 1.8ml label = ~378mg real — fine, slightly under.)_
> - **EQ stock:** 2 vials = 20ml ≈ **4,196mg real** → **~10.5 wks** at 1.9ml/wk → ~1.5ml short of a full 12-wk run. Grab a 3rd vial or taper the last 2 wks.
>
> **Test : EQ ratio** (EQ aromatises but blunts net E2 vs test-alone → run test relatively high):
>
> | Ratio | EQ (real) | Test E/wk | Test 12-wk need vs 9,000mg stock |
> |---|---|---|---|
> | **1.5 : 1** | 400mg | **600mg** | 7,200mg ✅ covered |
> | **2 : 1** | 400mg | **800mg** | 9,600mg ⚠️ ~600mg short — top up Test E |
>
> Pick the ratio at the post-cut DEXA; lean-bulk default leans **1.5:1** (600 Test / 400 EQ) unless E2/estrogenic sides push toward 2:1.
- **P2 Fuel:** small surplus **+200–500 kcal** (~0.25–0.5%/wk). Continue while gain holds ~0.5%/wk; if faster = fat → [[Mini-Cut & Accelerator Tiers|mini-cut]].
- **Support:** [[MK-677 (10mg×50tab) — kohohpharma|MK-677]], [[Retatrutide (60mg×10vial) — BFF-AMO|Retatrutide]] low (partitioning), [[Year-Round Shield]] (constant).
- **Forecast:** start **~81 kg @ 15%** (post-cut) → end **~85 kg @ 16%** (lean 69→71.6). +2.4 kg lean (aggressive). DEXA to course-correct vs [[FFMI Trajectory & Calorie Targets]].

